{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_05",
  "title": "物資回收計畫",
  "storyCode": "OD-5",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "733c18aef888f1c54989b884d080013c3465b9868d312b6180fedeecb1af4865",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_safehouseindoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "加油！Lord！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......嗯！！呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "差一點！還差一點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉上了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好樣的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......能徒手拉開這張弩，確實是一把好手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這弩的設計也太誇張了，表面上根本看不出來有這麼高的拉力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種重弩是很常見的類型，大部分薩卡茲人都能徒手拉開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種力道的重弩......100米以內威力不會比槍械小，就是用起來太費事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......有關體能差異這件事，我之前已經領教過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "搞不好那個放電的姑娘力氣都不比我小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是說雷蛇嗎？她畢竟是瓦伊凡，瓦伊凡確實是體格強壯的種族。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼突然對這些武器感興趣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然可預見的高頻度戰鬥在前，現在確實得思考一下彈藥用完後該怎麼辦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有子彈，槍械都是燒火棍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到時候總不能和他們肉搏吧，光從剛才的經歷來看，我覺得就沒什麼勝算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還剩下多少？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這邊不多了，不到400發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給你看個東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是什麼......子彈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是那位叫雷蛇的羅德島幹員使用的子彈，學名叫“蝕刻子彈”，據說是非常昂貴的產品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你已經拆開了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這子彈是什麼結構啊，發射藥呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是這塊結晶了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看著像是能量源，它是算發射藥還是戰鬥部？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老夫從前聽拉特蘭工匠講過，每一發蝕刻子彈內都裝著一塊微型施術單元，這些施術單元都與拉特蘭銃的結構相互對應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是說，不僅是銃器本身，就連它們發射的每一發蝕刻子彈都等同於術師的法杖，所以蝕刻子彈才會造價高昂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "與之對應的源石技藝也複雜深奧，只有薩科塔人才會大量使用銃器，其他人則會選擇更易於使用的遠端武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉特蘭是國名，薩科塔是種族名，拉特蘭人並不都是薩科塔......我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但關於子彈的部分可真是個壞消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個世界上就沒有什麼普通槍械嗎？不需要“源石技藝”的那種。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不需要源石技藝的銃械，老夫可從來沒聽說過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走一步看一步吧，至少那些爆炸物大家都能用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "科茨他們在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們在地下室，還在嘗試修復長得像無線電台的通訊器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_safehouseindoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "通訊施術單元還是無法供能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是能源的問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有可能......我得試試看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，你們躲開一點，優等生要開始表演了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......充能準備......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔！喔！喔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是源石技藝？這效果也太酷炫了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是......讓人印象深刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啟動了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幹得漂亮，不愧是我的移動能源小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你除了煩我，就沒有別的事情做了嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，還是無法接通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能是晶體電子單元損壞太嚴重了，也可能是其他地方的電路有肉眼不易察覺的損壞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡也沒有維修源石電路的專業設備，沒法系統性地排查問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，看起來是沒戲了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種源石技藝什麼的，普通人能學會嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "理論上說......絕大多數人經過培訓之後都可以學會一定程度的源石技藝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是源石技藝的學習需要付出心血與時間，而且也與天賦密切相關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很多人即便是付出了遠超他人的艱辛，最後也只能掌握一些最基礎的法術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老夫就是比較愚鈍的人，自始至終都沒能學會什麼源石技藝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在想什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼，只是一些對現狀的暢想......有點瘋癲，還缺乏實踐意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，對了，科茨先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來試試看吧，這面盾牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是怎麼......盾牌上面裝了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我根據你盾牌的原本結構和功能，安裝了高功率射燈和通用源石回路，應該能發揮出你慣用裝備的作用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非常感謝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯......可是我也不會“源石技藝”啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嚴格地說，通用源石回路，就是讓不會使用源石技藝的人也能使用源石設備的現代科技成果。這些設備裡可以儲存一些簡單的源石技藝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，裝置供能和設備維護還是需要專業術師來做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啊，讓我看看，還真有點沉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......開關......激發裝置......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒問題，我試試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啊！居然真的有效！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過我還得適應一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整整半年沒有頂盾衝鋒，我都快忘記怎麼用這東西了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_safehouseindoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "外面的動向如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上一輪攻擊也是最後一次敵對行動，至今都沒有再發生試探性進攻。我不覺得這是個好現象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尤其考慮到他們是一群組織有序的混蛋，這感覺就更不好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "暴風雨前的平靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生休息了，他已經好幾天沒睡覺了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓那個孩子歇歇吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他這個年齡，不該承擔這麼多事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "目前還有一個問題。我們的食物快要不夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是，之前奧克芬先生跟我說了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什麼想法嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在想，要不要回去一趟病人社區？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？你們有辦法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們離開那邊的時候非常匆忙，不少病人的家裡應該還有沒帶走的糧食。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確實。現在我們人手充足，可以去回收物資了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼事不宜遲，趕在天黑之前應該來得及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
